    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《我ê心肝仔囝》</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">/</span><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">方迎鳳</span></span></h1><div><span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjWIXhMGteeIZw_YfyI6Z-VcJ9i-5-D77th33ioqYVWDqQB233SbjuwdwNW3GZr2ocDYiadi_4hynK0BTSq__1QkY9KKCfOpwhYYTxwcIdi5_pm753aXJi1eYj53f1U94ranmCppulItd-C4CFOgXYLrldnwEUMEOGaDoEC_aUmG85vPyXgyZL1lMWujLhX\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjWIXhMGteeIZw_YfyI6Z-VcJ9i-5-D77th33ioqYVWDqQB233SbjuwdwNW3GZr2ocDYiadi_4hynK0BTSq__1QkY9KKCfOpwhYYTxwcIdi5_pm753aXJi1eYj53f1U94ranmCppulItd-C4CFOgXYLrldnwEUMEOGaDoEC_aUmG85vPyXgyZL1lMWujLhX\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgd5Fm2Umsq0fUIzRpjhKPHipg9u6BJcad1t64kFC8fkJZMldmpHO7gIwlGw6LpimPKm7tkTlDFmrL6SS6_3iQUPXw1R_F3egQM2h3AJ7_J59A8NL5BDiQZMh4rhKfDOgbVx1YWQsb2cDHMIZWGU04u6x5WUj0fLFnmAiNiXgiwtBchCXiEc0SMq1HBoOG4\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"729\" data-original-width=\"516\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgd5Fm2Umsq0fUIzRpjhKPHipg9u6BJcad1t64kFC8fkJZMldmpHO7gIwlGw6LpimPKm7tkTlDFmrL6SS6_3iQUPXw1R_F3egQM2h3AJ7_J59A8NL5BDiQZMh4rhKfDOgbVx1YWQsb2cDHMIZWGU04u6x5WUj0fLFnmAiNiXgiwtBchCXiEc0SMq1HBoOG4=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><br /></div></div></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">恭喜你tsit擺順利考tiâu公務人員，我lóng一直leh揣時間，想beh kah你開講，講一寡心內話，親像lán做人ê價值kah家己人生beh行ê道路。論真講，你是一个tsiok貼心koh bat代誌ê查某囝，m̄-koh有時我感覺你對家己無信心。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">自細漢tshiânn養你ê時tsūn，我對你是tsiok嚴格，真罕得kā你肯定，致使你tī人生學習ê過程中，無法度自由thián翼、自信發揮，時常ē感覺家己gōng、hân-bān，mā ná親像永遠無法度tī阿公阿媽ê面頭前hōo in開喙kā你呵咾。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">不而過，我真感謝有機會kah你做伙成長，hōo我mā學習beh ài按怎做好一个好老母、按怎用鼓勵ê方式，同時mā leh磨阿母ê性地kah學習。M̄-koh，阿母iáu-koh有真濟所在ài kah你做伙拍拚、做伙成長，hōo lán「互相激勵，m̄是leh互相làu-khuì，求進步。」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Lín姐弟仔lóng講：「我是一个tsiânn khiàng跤koh嚴格ê老母，無m̄-tio̍h，我承認tsit層代誌hām我細漢成長ê過程有真大ê關係，致使我m̄認輸ê個性，hōo我愛學杜定ê本性——ài保護家己，有時koh tio̍h激khong激gōng，無愛hōo人tī hia等leh看笑話、khau洗lín ê阿公阿媽hân-bān教囝。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">阿母ǹg望--你，ē-tàng kā tsia-ê看人無ê話，變做激勵你勇敢拚--落-去ê力量。Lán bat聽人講「骨力食栗，貧惰吞瀾」。相信無人愛失敗，m̄-koh失敗ê經驗ē hōo lán得著教訓，揣出成功ê方法，人tiānn-tiānn leh講「拍斷手骨顛倒勇」。你ài ē記得一句話：「戲棚跤徛久就是你ê。」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">阮做爸母--ê lóng是ǹg望序細，mài親像阮仝款，日子過kah hiah-nī艱苦。Mā無愛hōo你ná 小丑仔仝款leh hōo人笑。最後，阿母beh kā你講，恭喜你tsit幾年ê拍拚，有好ê成果，lán全家族lóng tsiok歡喜看著你ê成就，你永遠是阮心目中ê心肝仔寶貝。</span></div></div><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: cen